WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.093
Last week, measured from May

00:00:02.093 --> 00:00:04.037
eleventh to seventeenth in

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.981
Taipei time, the world was

00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:07.850
not defined by one event.

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.718
Two forces moved at once:

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:12.185
major powers tried to renegotiate

00:00:12.185 --> 00:00:14.129
order, while war risk kept

00:00:14.129 --> 00:00:15.400
spilling outward.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Start in Beijing.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.068
Donald Trump visited China

00:00:19.068 --> 00:00:21.439
from May thirteenth to fifteenth.

00:00:21.439 --> 00:00:23.379
After the talks, both sides

00:00:23.379 --> 00:00:26.038
emphasized trade repair, agricultural

00:00:26.038 --> 00:00:28.121
purchases, and market access.

00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:30.205
English-language reports said

00:00:30.205 --> 00:00:32.005
China committed to buying

00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:33.873
at least seventeen billion

00:00:33.873 --> 00:00:35.813
dollars in US farm products

00:00:35.813 --> 00:00:38.040
annually from twenty twenty-six

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.124
to twenty twenty-eight, while

00:00:40.124 --> 00:00:41.924
moving on access for beef

00:00:41.924 --> 00:00:42.200
and poultry.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.187
But this was not just a trade

00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:45.987
story.

00:00:45.987 --> 00:00:47.787
Taiwan was pulled into the

00:00:47.787 --> 00:00:49.587
same diplomatic frame.

00:00:49.587 --> 00:00:51.780
Reuters reported that Xi Jinping

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.767
warned Trump that mishandling

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.959
Taiwan could lead to a dangerous

00:00:55.959 --> 00:00:57.759
place.

00:00:57.759 --> 00:00:59.952
On May seventeenth, Lai Ching-te

00:00:59.952 --> 00:01:01.752
answered that Taiwan would

00:01:01.752 --> 00:01:03.552
not be sacrificed, traded

00:01:03.552 --> 00:01:05.352
away, or forced to accept

00:01:05.352 --> 00:01:07.152
an arrangement.In the same

00:01:07.152 --> 00:01:08.952
week, China said it would

00:01:08.952 --> 00:01:10.752
not allow Taiwan to attend

00:01:10.752 --> 00:01:12.552
the World Health Assembly,

00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:14.607
while Taiwan prepared meetings

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:16.457
outside the formal session.

00:01:16.457 --> 00:01:18.257
In other words, Taiwan was

00:01:18.257 --> 00:01:20.057
not a side issue.

00:01:20.057 --> 00:01:22.524
It was where great-power bargaining,

00:01:22.524 --> 00:01:22.900
international organizations,

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:22.900
and regional security overlapped.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:24.700
The second major line was

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.500
the Middle East.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.352
On May seventeenth, a drone

00:01:28.352 --> 00:01:30.152
incident near the Barakah

00:01:30.152 --> 00:01:31.952
nuclear power plant in the

00:01:31.952 --> 00:01:33.805
United Arab Emirates caused

00:01:33.805 --> 00:01:35.726
a fire, while officials said

00:01:35.726 --> 00:01:37.647
there were no casualties and

00:01:37.647 --> 00:01:39.447
no radiation leak.

00:01:39.447 --> 00:01:41.247
Saudi Arabia also reported

00:01:41.247 --> 00:01:43.168
drone interceptions the same

00:01:43.168 --> 00:01:44.968
day.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.958
Markets reacted quickly, with

00:01:46.958 --> 00:01:48.948
oil rising to a two-week high

00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:50.869
as traders worried about the

00:01:50.869 --> 00:01:52.669
Strait of Hormuz and Gulf

00:01:52.669 --> 00:01:54.521
energy routes.The key point

00:01:54.521 --> 00:01:56.579
was not only whether the plant

00:01:56.579 --> 00:01:58.379
was damaged.

00:01:58.379 --> 00:02:00.179
It was that drones, energy

00:02:00.179 --> 00:02:02.443
corridors, nuclear-site security,

00:02:02.443 --> 00:02:04.243
and oil-price expectations

00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:06.043
were now tied together.

00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:07.965
A regional war can move fast

00:02:07.965 --> 00:02:08.800
into global energy markets,

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:08.800
shipping insurance, and supply-chain

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:08.800
pricing.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.109
The third line was the continuing

00:02:11.109 --> 00:02:12.909
drone-ization of war.

00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:14.868
Russia said it had destroyed

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.687
large numbers of Ukrainian

00:02:16.687 --> 00:02:18.576
drones over the week, while

00:02:18.576 --> 00:02:20.745
Moscow faced one of its largest

00:02:20.745 --> 00:02:22.704
attacks in more than a year.

00:02:22.704 --> 00:02:24.593
Ukraine, meanwhile, was hit

00:02:24.593 --> 00:02:26.551
by large-scale Russian drone

00:02:26.551 --> 00:02:28.580
and missile attacks.The trend

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.609
is clear: war no longer stays

00:02:30.609 --> 00:02:32.409
at the front.

00:02:32.409 --> 00:02:34.858
Rear cities, energy infrastructure,

00:02:34.858 --> 00:02:37.237
transport nodes, and psychological

00:02:37.237 --> 00:02:39.037
security are all becoming

00:02:39.037 --> 00:02:40.837
targets.

00:02:40.837 --> 00:02:42.656
Drones lower the threshold

00:02:42.656 --> 00:02:44.475
for long-range strikes and

00:02:44.475 --> 00:02:46.300
make the battlefield wider,

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:46.300
more routine, and harder

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:46.300
to contain.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.751
The fourth line was the real-world

00:02:48.751 --> 00:02:50.551
cost behind the AI boom.

00:02:50.551 --> 00:02:52.353
Samsung Electronics faced

00:02:52.353 --> 00:02:54.154
strike risk over bonuses,

00:02:54.154 --> 00:02:56.317
pay, and profit sharing during

00:02:56.317 --> 00:02:58.191
a surge in AI-chip demand.

00:02:58.191 --> 00:03:00.497
South Korea's government stepped

00:03:00.497 --> 00:03:02.299
in because Samsung is not

00:03:02.299 --> 00:03:04.099
just one company.

00:03:04.099 --> 00:03:06.117
It is a major node in Korean

00:03:06.117 --> 00:03:07.919
exports and in the global

00:03:07.919 --> 00:03:09.865
semiconductor supply chain.

00:03:09.865 --> 00:03:11.883
AI is not only a story about

00:03:11.883 --> 00:03:13.683
model launches.

00:03:13.683 --> 00:03:16.206
It is also a story about factories,

00:03:16.206 --> 00:03:18.006
unions, and who captures

00:03:18.006 --> 00:03:20.024
the profits when chip demand

00:03:20.024 --> 00:03:21.824
rises.

00:03:21.824 --> 00:03:24.131
Workers, companies, governments,

00:03:24.131 --> 00:03:26.653
and customers are all renegotiating

00:03:26.653 --> 00:03:27.600
who gets the gains and who

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:27.600
carries disruption risk.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.400
Finally, public health and

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.366
climate reminded us that risk

00:03:31.366 --> 00:03:33.166
did not pause.

00:03:33.166 --> 00:03:35.268
WHO declared the Ebola outbreak

00:03:35.268 --> 00:03:37.068
in the Democratic Republic

00:03:37.068 --> 00:03:38.868
of the Congo and Uganda a

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:40.668
public health emergency of

00:03:40.668 --> 00:03:42.468
international concern.

00:03:42.468 --> 00:03:44.774
In the same week, Andes hantavirus

00:03:44.774 --> 00:03:46.672
infections linked to a South

00:03:46.672 --> 00:03:48.707
America cruise drew attention,

00:03:48.707 --> 00:03:50.605
while severe storms in Uttar

00:03:50.605 --> 00:03:51.400
Pradesh caused heavy casualties.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.424
So the week can be summarized

00:03:53.424 --> 00:03:55.796
this way: Beijing was negotiating,

00:03:55.796 --> 00:03:57.611
Taiwan was under pressure,

00:03:57.611 --> 00:03:59.495
the Gulf was still burning,

00:03:59.495 --> 00:04:01.309
Ukraine's war was becoming

00:04:01.309 --> 00:04:03.123
more drone-driven, and the

00:04:03.123 --> 00:04:05.426
AI supply chain was renegotiating

00:04:05.426 --> 00:04:07.226
profit distribution.

00:04:07.226 --> 00:04:09.040
These looked like separate

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.840
stories.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.724
Underneath, they pointed to

00:04:12.724 --> 00:04:14.748
one problem: the global order

00:04:14.748 --> 00:04:16.842
is trying to regain stability,

00:04:16.842 --> 00:04:18.642
while risk spreads at the

00:04:18.642 --> 00:04:20.735
same time through war, energy,

00:04:20.735 --> 00:04:22.828
technology, and public health.

00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:24.628
This is Codex Guanlan.

00:04:24.628 --> 00:04:26.500
We'll keep reading the world

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:26.500
across the lines next week.
